Merdeka, 1957 — Comic History Cartoon, 1080x1920, 10 s

Third-party material in the film, with source and licence:

Puppet part sheets
- src/sheet-britain.png and src/sheet-malaya.png: images made by the film's author with ChatGPT image generation
  (OpenAI), from the prompts in SHEETS.md, under OpenAI's terms. Keyed and cut into parts/ by tools/extract.py.
  The two puppets personify Britain and Malaya; they are not portraits of real people.

Map
- Natural Earth 1:50m admin-0 countries (public domain), via world-atlas 2.0.2 (ISC), clipped to 95–108°E, 3°S–12°N
  by tools/malaya_map.py into malaya.json. Default (not China-view) data: China is not in or near the frame.
- Malaya = the modern Peninsular Malaysia polygons, standing in for the Federation of Malaya's 1957 extent; the
  Malaya–Thailand line is the modern border (unchanged since the 1909 Anglo-Siamese Treaty). Error margin: the
  coastlines at 1:50m, a few kilometres.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence texts in fonts/)
- IM FELL English and IM FELL English SC (Igino Marini) · Lilita One (Juan Montoreano) · Old Standard TT (Alexey Kryukov)

Voice
- Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0) via kokoro-onnx, voice bm_george; every line checked with faster-whisper (base.en).
  Script: vo/lines.json.

Music and foley
- Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios),
  Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios). Score written in mix.py; paper foley synthesised in mix.py.

Code
- index.html, mix.py and tools/extract.py adapt the Comic History Cartoon demo code of the Lemo-Opuscar library
  (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 SecondFirst Pty Ltd. Rendering, voice, speech
  check, sampler and mastering tools from the same library (MIT).

History
- The Federation of Malaya became independent from Britain on 31 August 1957, after negotiations (the London
  conference of January–February 1956), not a war of independence. Singapore remained a British colony in 1957.
  Kuala Lumpur was the capital.
